# Profile administration (ADR 0024 §ProfileManager, §Profile creation, §PIN safety; ADR 0026).

"""
A Profile as its administrators see it (ADR 0024): its managers, the HouseholdAdmins of a Household
where it is available, and ServerAdmins.
"""
type ProfileAdministration {
    id: ID!
    name: String!
    kind: ProfileKind!
    maximumAllowedRatingAge: Int
    picture: String
    pinConfigured: Boolean!
    restricted: Boolean!
    """
    The Household the Profile belongs to, for the Profile's managers, for ServerAdmins and for the
    Accounts of that Household. Null for a HouseholdAdmin of a Household the Profile only visits:
    where a visitor comes from is not that Household's business.
    """
    household: HouseholdSummary
    "Whether the Profile is an Account's Personal Profile."
    linked: Boolean!
    """
    What the requesting Account is to the Profile. MANAGES for each of its ProfileManagers: the
    Account whose Personal Profile it is while that Profile is an unrestricted Adult, and every
    Account with a direct grant. SUPERVISES for a HouseholdAdmin who does not manage it while the
    restricted Profile is available in that Account's Household. Null for everyone else, a
    ServerAdmin who does not manage it included.
    """
    readerAuthority: ProfileAuthority
}

"One Profile an Account manages, in Household settings' list of them."
type ManagedProfile {
    "The Profile's administrative details, with the Household it belongs to."
    profile: ProfileAdministration!
    """
    Whether the Profile is available in the Household it belongs to. Management outlasts the end of
    its share there, so a Profile its manager can still open may not be.
    """
    available: Boolean!
}

"A page of the Profiles an Account manages."
type ManagedProfileConnection {
    edges: [ManagedProfileEdge!]!
    pageInfo: PageInfo!
}

"One Profile an Account manages and where it sits in the list."
type ManagedProfileEdge {
    node: ManagedProfile!
    cursor: String!
}

"One row of a Household's Profiles in Household settings."
type HouseholdProfile {
    "The Profile's administrative details. Its household is null for a visitor the reader does not manage."
    profile: ProfileAdministration!
    "Whether the Profile belongs to another Household and is shared into this one. The row never says which."
    visitor: Boolean!
    """
    Whether this Household's PIN safety rule keeps the Profile from being selected here until it
    has a PIN. False while the Profile is not available here.
    """
    locked: Boolean!
    """
    Whether the Profile is available in this Household. False only for a Profile the reader manages
    that belongs here after its share here ended; a HouseholdAdmin who does not manage it no longer
    sees it in the list.
    """
    available: Boolean!
}

"A page of a Household's Profiles."
type HouseholdProfileConnection {
    edges: [HouseholdProfileEdge!]!
    pageInfo: PageInfo!
}

"One of a Household's Profiles and where it sits in the list."
type HouseholdProfileEdge {
    node: HouseholdProfile!
    cursor: String!
}

"What an Account is to a Profile (ADR 0024)."
enum ProfileAuthority {
    "A ProfileManager: edits the Profile and its policy, manages its PIN, invites managers and offers it to Households."
    MANAGES
    """
    A HouseholdAdmin where the restricted Profile is available: edits its name, picture, content
    limit and PIN, never its kind, and never leaves it unrestricted.
    """
    SUPERVISES
}

"""
What a change of a Profile's kind or Content Ceiling, or a new Profile, would lock (ADR 0024 §PIN
safety), as the asking Account may already see it. The change itself is never refused for what it
locks.
"""
type ProfileLockPreview {
    """
    Whether the changed Profile, or the new one, would itself be locked until it has a PIN in any
    Household where it is available, whether or not households names that Household. A changed
    Profile that is locked there already does not count.
    """
    locksThisProfile: Boolean!
    """
    One entry for each Household where something would be locked that is not locked now, among the
    Households where the asking Account may already see that the Profile is available: those it
    may use, every Household where the changed Profile is available when it manages that Profile,
    and every one for a ServerAdmin. A new Profile's Household is always listed. Its own Household
    comes first, then the others by name.
    """
    households: [HouseholdLockPreview!]!
    """
    Whether Profiles that households does not name would be locked too: Profiles in a Household it
    leaves out, and Profiles in a listed Household that the asking Account may not see there. It
    says neither which, nor how many, nor where.
    """
    otherProfilesWillLock: Boolean!
}

"What a change, or a new Profile, would lock in one Household."
type HouseholdLockPreview {
    household: HouseholdSummary!
    """
    The other Profiles that would be locked there until each has a PIN, by name: those the asking
    Account may see there, because it may use the Household, manages the Profile, or is a
    ServerAdmin. otherProfilesWillLock says whether there are more.
    """
    profiles: [LockedProfile!]!
    """
    Whether the changed Profile, or the new one, would itself be locked there until it has a PIN.
    A changed Profile that is locked there already does not count.
    """
    locksThisProfile: Boolean!
}

"A Profile that a change would lock, as the Household's Profile picker shows it."
type LockedProfile {
    id: ID!
    name: String!
    picture: String
}

input CreateProfileInput {
    householdId: ID!
    name: String!
    kind: ProfileKind!
    maximumAllowedRatingAge: Int
    "Required when a remote ServerAdmin creates a restricted Profile."
    profileManagerAccountId: ID
}

type CreateProfilePayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [CreateProfileError!]!
}

union CreateProfileError =
    HouseholdNotFoundError
  | ProfileNameRequiredError
  | ProfileNameTakenError
  | ProfileRequiresEligibleManagerError
  | ProfileManagerNotEligibleError
  | AccountNotFoundError
  | MaximumAllowedRatingAgeInvalidError

input RenameProfileInput {
    profileId: ID!
    name: String!
}

type RenameProfilePayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [RenameProfileError!]!
}

union RenameProfileError =
    ProfileNotFoundError
  | ProfileNameRequiredError
  | ProfileNameTakenError

input SetProfilePictureInput {
    profileId: ID!
    picture: String!
}

type SetProfilePicturePayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [SetProfilePictureError!]!
}

union SetProfilePictureError = ProfileNotFoundError

input ChangeProfileKindInput {
    profileId: ID!
    kind: ProfileKind!
}

type ChangeProfileKindPayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [ChangeProfileKindError!]!
}

union ChangeProfileKindError =
    ProfileNotFoundError
  | ReauthenticationRequiredError
  | ProfileRequiresEligibleManagerError
  | RestrictedAccountCannotAdministerError
  | RestrictedProfileRequiresHouseholdAdminError
  | MaximumAllowedRatingAgeInvalidError

input SetProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgeInput {
    profileId: ID!
    maximumAllowedRatingAge: Int!
}

type SetProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgePayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [SetProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgeError!]!
}

union SetProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgeError =
    ProfileNotFoundError
  | ReauthenticationRequiredError
  | ProfileRequiresEligibleManagerError
  | RestrictedAccountCannotAdministerError
  | RestrictedProfileRequiresHouseholdAdminError
  | MaximumAllowedRatingAgeInvalidError

input RemoveProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgeInput {
    profileId: ID!
}

type RemoveProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgePayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [RemoveProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgeError!]!
}

union RemoveProfileMaximumAllowedRatingAgeError =
    ProfileNotFoundError
  | ReauthenticationRequiredError
  | ProfileRequiresEligibleManagerError
  | RestrictedAccountCannotAdministerError
  | RestrictedProfileRequiresHouseholdAdminError
  | MaximumAllowedRatingAgeInvalidError

input SetProfilePinInput {
    profileId: ID!
    pin: String!
}

type SetProfilePinPayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [SetProfilePinError!]!
}

union SetProfilePinError = ProfileNotFoundError | InvalidProfilePinError

input RemoveProfilePinInput {
    profileId: ID!
}

type RemoveProfilePinPayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [RemoveProfilePinError!]!
}

union RemoveProfilePinError = ProfileNotFoundError | ProfilePinRequiredError

input AdministrativelyResetProfilePinInput {
    profileId: ID!
    pin: String!
    reason: String!
}

type AdministrativelyResetProfilePinPayload {
    profile: ProfileAdministration
    userErrors: [AdministrativelyResetProfilePinError!]!
}

union AdministrativelyResetProfilePinError =
    ProfileNotFoundError
  | InvalidProfilePinError
  | ReasonRequiredError
  | ReauthenticationRequiredError

input DeleteProfileInput {
    profileId: ID!
}

type DeleteProfilePayload {
    deletedProfileId: ID
    userErrors: [DeleteProfileError!]!
}

union DeleteProfileError =
    ProfileNotFoundError
  | ProfileNotDeletableError
  | ReauthenticationRequiredError
